# INVWINIK.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: INS and DEL with
# SHIFT or CTRL, Windows 3.0's clipboard keys, do nothing in a list: on
# the item list CTRL-INS and SHIFT-INS open no new item and SHIFT-DEL
# asks no delete, while INS and DEL alone still do; the Categories
# dialog's list the same.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINIK.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-INS
S CTRLINS
K SHIFT-INS
S SHIFTINS
K SHIFT-DEL
S SHIFTDEL
K INS
S NEW
K ESC DEL
S DELQ
K N ALT-I C CTRL-INS
S CCTRLINS
K SHIFT-INS
S CSHINS
K SHIFT-DEL
S CSHDEL
K INS
S CNEW
K ESC DEL
S CDELQ
K N ESC ALT-F X
